          <p class="text">
            We find the work your team still does by hand, like matching purchase orders to invoices,
            and automate it. A person still checks the exceptions.
          </p>
          <p class="meta"><a class="meta-link link-draw" href={SITE.CALENDLY_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Starts with a free 30-minute call</a></p>
        </div>
